’s status list, as last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checked ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.checkStatus(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStatus"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helps without personal data."}],"role":"article","title":"Handling errors","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyAgreement":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyAgreement","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyAgreement"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"KeyAgreement","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"ECDH with the wallet’s holder keys inside the key store, for deviceMac"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in person (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §9.1.3.5). A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" that is also one is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used for it when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletConfiguration.proximityDeviceAuth"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".macPreferred"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is one."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyAgreement"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keyagreement"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"title":"FileCredentialStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReader":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityReader","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreader","kind":"symbol","title":"ProximityReader","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An ISO\/IEC 18013-5 mdoc reader: a verifier asking for an mdoc in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over BLE. It needs no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":". The key store holds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader’s key, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProximityReaderConfiguration.readerKeyID"},{"type":"text","text":"; none for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that doesn’t sign."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityReader","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"title":"KeyStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Presenting in person","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GettingStarted":{"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting started","url